Le jeudi 22 février 2024 à 17:27:33 UTC+1, Chris Paciorek a écrit :
> Hi Frédéric,
>
> It's the case that nimble's AD system does not provide derivatives for cumulative distribution ('p') and quantile ('q') functions at the moment (which affects use of truncated distributions). We don't have a firm plan at the moment for when we'll add that capability.
>
> -chris
>
