Thank you very much Wei. This answers my question: the  $getNodeNamesVec(returnParams = TRUE) is what I looked for. indeed, I did not want to re-declare all the parameters, only those that are integrated on. Then if I know the active parameters - top level stochastic nodes - and their order, I think I have what I need to do the job.

Sincerely,

Frédéric

