Dear Vitor,
Welcome to nimble. This list is primarily for topics on the software rather than all the statistical modeling issues related to applications of the software. That said, it looks to me like the dZMP you wrote is very similar to the dZIP you found in our examples, with the only changes being that your p is (1-zeroProb) of dZIP and your lambda is the theta of dZIP. If that is correct, your code looks reasonable.
HTH
Perry

